# Intentionally minimal.
# For Next.js static export on Netlify, avoid SPA-style rewrites that
# would intercept `/_next/static/*` assets (CSS/JS) and break styling.
# NOTE: Netlify handles HTTP→HTTPS automatically — do NOT add http→https
# rules here as that creates redirect chains (Netlify HTTPS + our rule = 2 hops).

# Force www → non-www (single hop — Netlify already upgraded to HTTPS)
https://www.devsolvev2.com/*  https://devsolvev2.com/:splat  301!
